meta {
  name: Auth
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Logs in the demo users and stores their tokens for the other folders:
  ownerToken (orc-shack owner), dragonOwnerToken, frodoToken and samToken
  (customers). Each login also sets {{token}}, which every request inherits,
  so by hand you act as whoever logged in last. The owner logs in last.
  Tokens are opaque: send them as Authorization: Bearer.
}
